OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel to close within weeks
OL,4,
OL,5,FA hotel in Warwick will no longer be
OL,6,Fused to house asylum seekers from early
OL,7,Fnext year, an MP has said.
OL,9,FThe Delta Hotel, on Stratford Road,
OL,10,Ffirst shut to the public and was
OL,11,Frepurposed to house asylum seekers in
OL,12,FNovember 2024.
OL,14,FMatt Western, MP for Warwick and
OL,15,FLeamington, said he received
OL,16,Fconfirmation from the Home Office
OL,17,Ffollowing several meetings and
OL,18,Fcorrespondence with officials
OL,19,Frequesting it should be closed.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
