OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel to close within weeks
OL,4,
OL,5,FA Home Office spokesperson said: "We
OL,6,Fare working to fairly house asylum
OL,7,Fseekers across the country while
OL,8,Fengaging closely with local authorities
OL,9,Fto minimise impacts on communities."
